# Base URL of the testset-generator backend API.
# Endpoints are called at <VITE_API_URL>/v1/...
# Leave unset in production to use same-origin "/api" (e.g. behind nginx / Cloudflare proxy).
# For local dev with the backend on another port:
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
# If the API is unreachable at startup, the app falls back to a built-in demo mode
# with in-memory mock data (a banner shows "Demo mode — API not connected").
